SIR per unit of TEA for a given vault"},"getReserves((address,address,int8))":{"params":{"vaultParams":"A 3-tuple of parameters identifying a vault: (1) collateral token, (2) debt token, and (3) leverage tier."},"returns":{"_0":"The vault's reserves, meaning a 3-tuple of (1) the amount of collateral in the vault belonging to apes,  (2) the amount of collateral belonging to LPers, and (3) the current collateral-debt-token price in fixed point."}},"hyperswapV3SwapCallback(int256,int256,bytes)":{"details":"This callback function is required by Uniswap pools when making a swap. This function is exectuted when the user decides to mint TEA or APE with debt token. This function is in charge of sending the debt token to the uniswwap pool. It will revert if any external actor that is not a Uniswap pool calls this function."},"initialize((address,address,int8))":{"details":"The initialization deploys a new ERC20 APE token, and potentially initializes the Oracle."},"mint(bool,(address,address,int8),uint256,uint144,uint40)":{"details":"You can mint by depositing collateral token or, alternatively, with debt token if collateralToDepositMin set to a non-zero amount. You also have the option to mint with vanilla HYPE when the token is WHYPE by simply sending HYPE with the call. In this case, amountToDeposit is ignored.","params":{"amountToDeposit":"Amount of collateral to deposit, or if collateralToDepositMin > 0, amount of debt token to deposit.","collateralToDepositMin":"Ignored when minting with collateral token, otherwise it specifies the MINIMUM amount of collateral to receive from Uniswap when swapping the debt token.","deadline":"The timestamp after which the transaction will be invalid. If the caller sets it to 0, deadline has no effect.","isAPE":"If true, mint APE. If false, mint TEA","vaultParams":"The 3 parameters identifying a vault."},"returns":{"amount":"Amount of TEA/APE send to the caller."}},"safeBatchTransferFrom(address,address,uint256[],uint256[],bytes)":{"params":{"amounts":"The amounts to transfer.","from":"The account to transfer from.","to":"The account to transfer to.","vaultIds":"The vaults to transfer from."}},"safeTransferFrom(address,address,uint256,uint256,bytes)":{"params":{"from":"The account to transfer from.","to":"The account to transfer to.","vaultId":"The vault to transfer from."}},"systemParams()":{"returns":{"systemParams_":"A 4-tuple that includes (1) the base fee, (2) the LP fee,  (3) whether minting is stopped, and (4) the cumulative tax."}},"unclaimedRewards(uint256,address)":{"params":{"lper":"The address of the LPer to query.","vaultId":"The id of the vault to query."}},"updateSystemState(uint16,uint16,bool)":{"details":"This function can only be called by the SystemControl contract. It updates the base fee charge to apes, the fee charged to LPers when minting or haults all minting. All these parameters are updated in a single function for bytecode efficiency. All checks and balances are done at the SystemControl contract."},"updateVaults(uint48[],uint48[],uint8[],uint16)":{"details":"This function can only be called by the SystemControl contract. Updates the tax of the vaults whose fees are distributed to stakers of SIR. The amount of SIR rewards received by LPers of a vault is proportional to the tax of the vault. 0 tax implies no SIR rewards. All checks and balances are done at the SystemControl contract."},"vaultStates((address,address,int8))":{"params":{"vaultParams":"The 3 parameters identifying a vault: collateral token, debt token, and leverage tier."}},"withdrawFees(address)":{"details":"The fees collected from the vaults are are distributed to SIR stakers.","params":{"token":"to be distributed"},"returns":{"totalFeesToStakers":"is the total amount of tokens to be distributed"}},"withdrawToSaveSystem(address[],address)":{"details":"This function is only intended to be called as last recourse to save the system from a critical bug or hack during the beta period. To execute it, the system must be in Shutdown status which can only be activated after SHUTDOWN_WITHDRAWAL_DELAY seconds elapsed since Emergency status was activated.","params":{"to":"is the recipient of the tokens","tokens":"is a list of tokens to be withdrawn."},"returns":{"amounts":"is the list of amounts of tokens to be withdrawn"}}},"stateVariables":{"APE_IMPLEMENTATION":{"details":"The address of the APE implementation."},"ORACLE":{"details":"The Oracle contract used for getting the price of collateral vs. debt token."}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"SYSTEM_CONTROL()":{"notice":"Address of the SystemControl contract."},"TIMESTAMP_ISSUANCE_START()":{"notice":"Unix timestamp when SIR was launched and SIR token issuance started."},"balanceOf(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Returns the balance of an account for a specific vault"},"balanceOfBatch(address[],uint256[])":{"notice":"Returns the balances of multiple accounts for specific vaults."},"burn(bool,(address,address,int8),uint256,uint40)":{"notice":"Function for burning APE or TEA, the protocol's synthetic tokens, and getting collateral token in return."},"getReserves((address,address,int8))":{"notice":"Function for getting the reserves of a specific vault."},"initialize((address,address,int8))":{"notice":"Initializize (create) a new vault with specific parameters. It will revert if the vault already exists."},"isApprovedForAll(address,address)":{"notice":"Checks if an operator is approved to transfer on behalf of an account.The first address is the account, the second is the operator."},"mint(bool,(address,address,int8),uint256,uint144,uint40)":{"notice":"Function for minting APE or TEA, the protocol's synthetic tokens."},"numberOfVaults()":{"notice":"Returns the number of existing vaults."},"paramsById(uint48)":{"notice":"Returns vault parameters by vault ID."},"safeBatchTransferFrom(address,address,uint256[],uint256[],bytes)":{"notice":"Transfers TEA from multiple vaults."},"safeTransferFrom(address,address,uint256,ui